Third-party and derived work
----------------------------

Herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), Apache License 2.0.

- mods/agentee-spaces is a fork of Herdr's default `spaces` mod.
- mods/agentee-agents-list is a fork of Herdr's default `agents` mod.
- mods/agentee-new-menu is a fork of Herdr's default `new-menu` mod.
- mods/agentee-agents/tokens.mjs derives from Herdr's `insights` token scanner
  (mods/insights/analytics.js) and reads the user's own agent session logs.
- Icon shapes follow Lucide icons (ISC) as used by Herdr.

Changes from the originals are limited to styling, layout ids, empty-machine
row handling, the self-opening sort menu name, and the new-tab menu creating
the space with the chosen terminal instead of before the picker opens. The
Apache-2.0 license and this notice apply to the derived files.
